          "op": "set_tool_description",
          "tool": "list_issues",
          "value": "List issues, optionally filtered by status and assignee. Use to browse or enumerate issues; use search_issues to find issues by text in the title or body, and get_issue for one known ID. Returns at most 50 issues unless limit is set. Comments are included by default; set include_comments to false for smaller responses.",
